end":170,"surface":"亞夫","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0183","start":183,"end":187,"surface":"高貴鄉公","kind":"person","person_id":"d6b_ea7_928","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"劉毅","kind":"person","person_id":"fcn_avk_8w3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"劉寔","kind":"person","person_id":"ohv_l50_sf5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0207","start":207,"end":209,"surface":"程咸","kind":"person","person_id":"549_f84_359","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"庾峻","kind":"person","person_id":"524_294_dab","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0222","start":222,"end":226,"surface":"常道鄉公","kind":"person","person_id":"gke_14h_1xk_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":15,"last_line":15,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　毌丘儉作亂，景帝自出征之，百官祖送於城東，袤疾病不任會。帝謂中領軍王肅曰：「唯不見鄭光祿為恨。」肅以語袤，袤自輿追帝，及於近道。帝笑曰：「故知侯生必來也。」遂與袤共載，曰：「計將何先？」袤曰：「昔與儉俱為台郎，特所知悉。其人好謀而不達事情，自昔建勳幽州，志望無限。文欽勇而無算。今大軍出其不意，江、淮之卒銳而不能固，深溝高壘以挫其氣，此亞夫之長也。」帝稱善。轉太常。高貴鄉公議立明堂辟雍，精選博士，袤舉劉毅、劉寔、程咸、庾峻，後並至公輔大位。及常道鄉公立，與議定策，進封安城鄉侯，邑千戶。景元初，疾病失明，屢乞骸骨，不許。拜光祿大夫。五等初建，封密陵伯。","raw_start":840,"raw_end":1119,"raw_line":15},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jin